-- ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
-- EMERGENCY FIX: Manually Populate Function Permissions
-- ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
-- This script will:
-- 1. Check if empresa_profissionais has funcao data
-- 2. If YES but empresa_funcoes_permitidas is empty, populate it
-- 3. If NO, create default functions for each operational company
-- ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

-- STEP 1: Diagnostic
DO $$
DECLARE
  ep_funcao_count INT;
  efp_count INT;
  operational_companies INT;
BEGIN
  -- Count funcao records in empresa_profissionais
  SELECT COUNT(*) INTO ep_funcao_count
  FROM empresa_profissionais
  WHERE funcao IS NOT NULL AND ativo = true;
  
  -- Count records in empresa_funcoes_permitidas
  SELECT COUNT(*) INTO efp_count
  FROM empresa_funcoes_permitidas;
  
  -- Count operational companies
  SELECT COUNT(*) INTO operational_companies
  FROM empresas
  WHERE empresa_tipo = 'operacional' AND ativo = true;
  
  RAISE NOTICE '========================================';
  RAISE NOTICE 'DIAGNOSTIC REPORT';
  RAISE NOTICE '========================================';
  RAISE NOTICE 'empresa_profissionais with funcao: %', ep_funcao_count;
  RAISE NOTICE 'empresa_funcoes_permitidas: %', efp_count;
  RAISE NOTICE 'operational companies (active): %', operational_companies;
  RAISE NOTICE '========================================';
END $$;

-- STEP 2: Populate from existing data (if exists)
INSERT INTO empresa_funcoes_permitidas (
  tenant_id,
  empresa_operacional_id,
  funcao,
  ativo
)
SELECT DISTINCT ON (e.id, ep.funcao)
  COALESCE(e.tenant_id, e.id) as tenant_id,
  e.id as empresa_operacional_id,
  ep.funcao,
  true
FROM empresa_profissionais ep
JOIN empresas e ON e.id = ep.empresa_id
WHERE ep.funcao IS NOT NULL
AND e.ativo = true
ORDER BY e.id, ep.funcao
ON CONFLICT (empresa_operacional_id, funcao) DO NOTHING;

-- STEP 3: If still empty, create default functions for ALL operational companies
-- This ensures workflow mode works even if empresa_profissionais doesn't have funcao data
INSERT INTO empresa_funcoes_permitidas (
  tenant_id,
  empresa_operacional_id,
  funcao,
  ativo
)
SELECT 
  COALESCE(e.tenant_id, e.id) as tenant_id,
  e.id,
  f.funcao,
  true
FROM empresas e
CROSS JOIN (
  VALUES 
    ('Designer'),
    ('Redator'),
    ('Social Media'),
    ('Revisor')
) AS f(funcao)
WHERE e.empresa_tipo = 'operacional'
  AND e.ativo = true
  AND NOT EXISTS (
    SELECT 1 
    FROM empresa_funcoes_permitidas efp 
    WHERE efp.empresa_operacional_id = e.id
  )
ON CONFLICT (empresa_operacional_id, funcao) DO NOTHING;

-- STEP 4: Final Report
DO $$
DECLARE
  final_count INT;
  companies_with_functions INT;
BEGIN
  SELECT COUNT(*) INTO final_count
  FROM empresa_funcoes_permitidas;
  
  SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT empresa_operacional_id) INTO companies_with_functions
  FROM empresa_funcoes_permitidas;
  
  RAISE NOTICE '========================================';
  RAISE NOTICE 'FINAL REPORT';
  RAISE NOTICE '========================================';
  RAISE NOTICE 'Total function permissions: %', final_count;
  RAISE NOTICE 'Companies with functions: %', companies_with_functions;
  RAISE NOTICE '========================================';
  
  IF final_count = 0 THEN
    RAISE WARNING 'STILL NO FUNCTIONS! Manual intervention required.';
  ELSE
    RAISE NOTICE 'SUCCESS! Functions are now available.';
  END IF;
END $$;
